    <description>1. Pre-Authorization Auto-Routing and SLA Tracking

Objects: Custom Pre_Authorization__c (Fields: Status__c, Treatment_Type__c, Estimated_Cost__c, SLA_Due_Date__c).

Requirement: When a record is created, automatically assign it to the &quot;High-Value Approvals&quot; queue if the cost exceeds $5,000. For all records, calculate and set the SLA_Due_Date__c to exactly 48 business hours from creation, skipping weekends.</description>
